summary:
Companies Announce New Multi-Year Consumer Financing Program;

Synchrony To Become Exclusive Issuer of J.Crew And J.Crew Factory Credit Cards;

Co-Branded Credit Card Program To Provide Rewards and Benefits For Purchases Made Outside of J.Crew Group, Wherever Mastercard Is Accepted

NEW YORK, PURCHASE, N.Y. and STAMFORD, Conn., Nov. 29, 2023 /PRNewswire/ -- J.Crew Group, today announced it has entered into a new, multi-year credit card program agreement with Synchrony (NYSE: SYF) and Mastercard
